        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Just to be clear, `libiconv` and `gettext` are _only_ used on Windows (at least in our own builds), so we could switch to something like https://github.com/pffang/libiconv-for-Windows or make this a runtime dependency either via [vcpkg](https://vcpkg.io/en/package/libiconv.html) or [this project](https://github.com/mlocati/gettext-iconv-windows).\n",
