            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "As the Zig build -- and hence our CI -- relies on the upstream GNU servers, we are tied to them anyway and can just as well use that for the CMake builds as well and just drop our mirrors entirely.\n\n(It still makes sense to investigate simplifying our dependency chain, but resolving the neovim/deps issue does not rely on that.)",
