            "body": "> do we cache that dep source already? does it have its own \"key\" (thus should basically ~never need to fetch from GNU servers)\n\nWe don't and we can't (manually; there's the zig cache of course, but @bfredl would need to say if that is impacted).\n\nBut we recently had a brownout that made all our Zig jobs fail (which is in fact what triggered this crusade), so my guess is \"no\".",
