            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Tentative suggested strategy:\n* Switch to https://github.com/pffang/libiconv-for-Windows for our CMake dependencies, making it Windows-only\n* On all other platforms, switch to using system libraries in Zig build as well (needs fixing for macOS, #41546)\n* Inline `libintl.h` on all platforms for consistency (#41541)\n* Make `gettext` binaries an (optional) external build dependency (`winget install -e --id GnuWin32.GetText`)",
